	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Usage

Search BunPro grammar points via the `bps` keyword. Type kana, romaji, or English to filter.

![BunPro grammar search](images/about/search.png)

* &lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; Open the selected grammar point on BunPro.

Browse your BunPro dashboard via the `bp` keyword.

* `bp &lt;page&gt;` - open a page: `summary`, `stats`, `levels`, `forecast`, `leeches`.
* Text after the page filters its rows, e.g. `bp forecast tomorrow`.
* Delete the page name to go back to the menu.
* Pages load in the background: `Loading &lt;page&gt;…` shows until the data arrives, then cached pages open instantly.
* First row on every page is the page itself: &lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; opens the dashboard, &lt;kbd&gt;⇥&lt;/kbd&gt; goes back.

![BunPro dashboard menu](images/about/main.png)

* &lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; Open the selected dashboard view.

Open the Summary view to see your current BunPro progress.

![BunPro dashboard summary](images/about/summary.png)

Set the keywords and API token in the [Workflow's Configuration](https://www.alfredapp.com/help/workflows/user-configuration/).

### Maintenance

* `:bp` - cache size (&lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; reveals the folder) and Empty Cache.
</string>
